<title>BELGIUM: EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for Italy.</title>
<headline>EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for Italy.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Italy relased on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		1.2	   2.0</p>
<p> Investment			2.2	   5.5</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    2.7	   2.4</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	   12.0	   11.6</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 3.2	   3.9</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		122.4	 120.7</p>
</text>
